    {"id": "bmfnru", "kind": "text", "text": "{.title}\n# Simply supported steel beam", "at": [0, 0]},
    {"id": "bmawah", "kind": "text", "text": "IPE section in S355 under a uniform load · EN 1993-1-1", "at": [0, 34]},
    {
      "id": "bmhfkd",
      "kind": "table",
      "header": {"column": true},
      "columns": [{"width": 104}, {"width": 210}],
      "rows": [
        ["Project", "Project name"],
        ["Client", "Client name"],
        ["Element", "Floor beam B1"],
        ["Prepared by", "A. Engineer"]
      ],
      "at": [0, 69]
    },
    {
      "id": "bmabaa",
      "kind": "table",
      "header": {"column": true},
      "columns": [{"width": 104}, {"width": 210}],
      "rows": [
        ["Document no.", "CALC-STR-002"],
        ["Revision", "A"],
        ["Date", "YYYY-MM-DD"],
        ["Checked by", "—"]
      ],
      "at": [328, 69]
    },
    {"id": "bmbnvk", "kind": "toc", "of": "checks", "title": "Summary of checks", "at": [0, 186]},
    {
      "id": "bmnddm",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The total deflection check fails on purpose, to show a failing check. An IPE 330 (I~y~ = 11 770 cm⁴, W~pl,y~ = 804.3 cm³) passes them all.",
      "at": [0, 430]
    },
    {"id": "bmgkvr", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Design basis", "at": [0, 494]},
    {
      "id": "bmykug",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Steel beam, simply supported, with its compression flange restrained by the floor, so lateral-torsional buckling (6.3.2) does not govern. ULS to EN 1990 (6.10), SLS characteristic. Clauses refer to EN 1993-1-1. National annex values are taken as the recommended values.",
      "at": [0, 526]
    },
    {"id": "bmgusd", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Data", "at": [0, 601]},
    {"id": "bmxman", "kind": "math", "expr": "L:=7 m", "note": "span", "at": [0, 633]},
    {"id": "bmehaz", "kind": "math", "expr": "f.y:=355 MPa", "at": [220, 633]},
    {"id": "bmzewn", "kind": "math", "expr": "E:=210 GPa", "at": [440, 633]},
    {"id": "bmuxim", "kind": "math", "expr": "h:=300 mm", "note": "IPE 300", "at": [0, 673]},
    {"id": "bmnash", "kind": "math", "expr": "b:=150 mm", "at": [220, 673]},
    {"id": "bmrncc", "kind": "math", "expr": "t.w:=7.1 mm", "at": [440, 673]},
    {"id": "bmutjn", "kind": "math", "expr": "t.f:=10.7 mm", "at": [0, 708]},
    {"id": "bmhhim", "kind": "math", "expr": "r:=15 mm", "at": [220, 708]},
    {"id": "bmqiuy", "kind": "math", "expr": "A:=53.81 cm^2", "at": [440, 708]},
    {"id": "bmburh", "kind": "math", "expr": "I.y:=8356 cm^4", "at": [0, 743]},
    {"id": "bmzfah", "kind": "math", "expr": "W.pl.y:=628.4 cm^3", "at": [220, 743]},
    {"id": "bmqeab", "kind": "math", "expr": "γ.M0:=1.0", "at": [440, 743]},
    {
      "id": "bmyvup",
      "kind": "table",
      "name": "loads",
      "header": {"row": true},
      "caption": {"text": "Loads per metre, including self-weight", "position": "above"},
      "display": {"decimals": 2},
      "columns": [{"width": 130}, {"width": 120, "align": "right"}, {"width": 70, "align": "right"}, {"width": 120, "align": "right"}],
      "rows": [
        ["Load", "Characteristic", "γ", "Design"],
        ["Permanent", "6 kN/m", "1.35", "=B2*C2"],
        ["Variable", "8 kN/m", "1.5", "=B3*C3"],
        ["Total", "=SUM(B2:B3)", "", "=SUM(D2:D3)"]
      ],
      "at": [0, 781]
    },
    {"id": "bmdcah", "kind": "math", "expr": "g.k:=loads[2, 2]", "show": "value", "at": [0, 908]},
    {"id": "bmwryc", "kind": "math", "expr": "q.k:=loads[3, 2]", "show": "value", "at": [220, 908]},
    {"id": "bmdfif", "kind": "math", "expr": "q.d:=loads[4, 4]", "show": "value", "at": [440, 908]},
    {"id": "bmjyem", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Internal forces", "at": [0, 958]},
    {
      "id": "bmydwi",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Design bending moment and shear force along the span, drawn in [](#ref:bmmjdd) and [](#ref:bmxprt).",
      "at": [0, 990]
    },
    {"id": "bmckfv", "kind": "math", "expr": "M(x):=q.d*x*(L-x)/2", "at": [0, 1023]},
    {"id": "bmidth", "kind": "math", "expr": "V(x):=q.d*(L/2-x)", "at": [330, 1023]},
    {
      "id": "bmmjdd",
      "kind": "plot2d",
      "size": [310, 190],
      "series": [{"y": "M(x)", "x": "x", "range": "0 m..L", "label": "M.Ed"}],
      "axes": {"x": {"unit": "m", "label": "x"}, "y": {"unit": "kN*m", "label": "M"}},
      "grid": true,
      "extrema": true,
      "caption": {"text": "Design bending moment"},
      "at": [0, 1077]
    },
    {
      "id": "bmxprt",
      "kind": "plot2d",
      "size": [310, 190],
      "series": [{"y": "V(x)", "x": "x", "range": "0 m..L", "label": "V.Ed"}],
      "axes": {"x": {"unit": "m", "label": "x"}, "y": {"unit": "kN", "label": "V"}},
      "grid": true,
      "extrema": true,
      "caption": {"text": "Design shear force"},
      "at": [332, 1077]
    },
    {"id": "bmqyeu", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Cross-section class", "at": [0, 1317]},
    {
      "id": "bmerbk",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "ε:=sqrt(235 MPa/f.y)",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"decimals": 3},
      "note": "Table 5.2",
      "at": [0, 1349]
    },
    {
      "id": "bmrizf",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "c.f:=(b-t.w-2*r)/2",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"decimals": 1},
      "note": "flange outstand",
      "at": [0, 1415]
    },
    {"id": "bmzsyj", "kind": "math", "expr": "c.f/t.f<=9*ε", "note": "flange, Class 1", "at": [360, 1415]},
    {"id": "bmaiab", "kind": "math", "expr": "c.w:=h-2*t.f-2*r", "show": "value", "display": {"decimals": 1}, "note": "web", "at": [0, 1465]},
    {"id": "bmewuz", "kind": "math", "expr": "c.w/t.w<=72*ε", "note": "web in bending, Class 1", "at": [360, 1465]},
    {"id": "bmkdfg", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Ultimate limit state", "at": [0, 1527]},
    {"id": "bmyyyq", "kind": "text", "text": "## Bending", "at": [0, 1563]},
    {"id": "bmdnwh", "kind": "math", "expr": "M.Ed:=M(L/2)", "show": "value", "display": {"unit": "kN*m"}, "note": "midspan", "at": [0, 1591]},
    {
      "id": "bmqyvy",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "M.c.Rd:=W.pl.y*f.y/γ.M0",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kN*m"},
      "note": "6.2.5 (6.13)",
      "at": [0, 1644]
    },
    {"id": "bmcsxq", "kind": "math", "expr": "M.Ed<=M.c.Rd", "note": "bending, 6.2.5(1)", "at": [0, 1706]},
    {"id": "bmxnya", "kind": "text", "text": "## Shear", "at": [0, 1745]},
    {"id": "bmucqw", "kind": "math", "expr": "V.Ed:=V(0 m)", "show": "value", "display": {"unit": "kN"}, "note": "support", "at": [0, 1773]},
    {"id": "bmujee", "kind": "math", "expr": "h.w:=h-2*t.f", "show": "value", "display": {"decimals": 1}, "at": [330, 1773]},
    {"id": "bmxzen", "kind": "math", "expr": "η:=1.0", "note": "6.2.6(3), conservative", "at": [0, 1808]},
    {
      "id": "bmcxke",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "A.v:=max(A-2*b*t.f+(t.w+2*r)*t.f, η*h.w*t.w)",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "cm^2"},
      "note": "rolled I section, 6.2.6(3)a",
      "at": [0, 1843]
    },
    {
      "id": "bmkkvj",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "V.pl.Rd:=A.v*f.y/(sqrt(3)*γ.M0)",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kN"},
      "note": "6.2.6 (6.18)",
      "at": [0, 1880]
    },
    {"id": "bmpdpj", "kind": "math", "expr": "V.Ed<=V.pl.Rd", "note": "shear, 6.2.6(1)", "at": [0, 1945]},
    {"id": "bmdnmu", "kind": "math", "expr": "h.w/t.w<=72*ε/η", "note": "no shear buckling check, 6.2.6(6)", "at": [0, 1982]},
    {"id": "bmkimr", "kind": "math", "expr": "V.Ed<=0.5*V.pl.Rd", "note": "no reduction for shear, 6.2.8(2)", "at": [0, 2036]},
    {"id": "bmqwpy", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Serviceability limit state", "at": [0, 2085]},
    {
      "id": "bmenej",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Deflection under characteristic loads; the limits are project values (EN 1990, A1.4.3).",
      "at": [0, 2117]
    },
    {"id": "bmuchz", "kind": "math", "expr": "δ.lim.tot:=L/300", "note": "total", "at": [0, 2150]},
    {"id": "bmhagm", "kind": "math", "expr": "δ.lim.q:=L/360", "note": "variable action", "at": [330, 2150]},
    {
      "id": "bmvcgf",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "δ.tot:=5*(g.k+q.k)*L^4/(384*E*I.y)",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "mm", "decimals": 1},
      "at": [0, 2200]
    },
    {
      "id": "bmfqhh",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "δ.q:=5*q.k*L^4/(384*E*I.y)",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "mm", "decimals": 1},
      "at": [0, 2265]
    },
    {"id": "bmtfxx", "kind": "math", "expr": "δ.tot<=δ.lim.tot", "note": "total deflection", "at": [0, 2327]},
    {"id": "bmdphp", "kind": "math", "expr": "δ.q<=δ.lim.q", "note": "deflection from variable action", "at": [330, 2327]}
  ]
}
